# The database file and its WAL companions. The .htaccess that denies them must still ship.
data/*
!data/.htaccess

# Written into the download by the release workflow, never committed: it is how many commits
# main had when that archive was built. A BUILD file in a checkout would let the checkout claim
# a number it did not earn — a checkout says "from a checkout" instead, which is the truth.
BUILD
